{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptive-prediction-sets","title":"自适应预测集 (APS)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/adaptive-prediction-sets","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自适应预测集-aps\">自适应预测集 (APS)</h1><p>把&quot;1 减真标签概率&quot;当评分，分类 CP 会犯一个让人尴尬的错：对模型很有把握的简单图片，它给一个标签的小集合；对模型犹豫不决的困难图片，它常常也只给一个标签——于是困难样本被系统性欠覆盖，简单样本却被过度保守。自适应预测集（Adaptive Prediction Sets，APS）正是为修这个错而生：它让标签集的<strong>大小随样本难度自动伸缩</strong>，是分类 CP 近年最重要的实用进展，也是 <a href=\"../methods/nonconformity-scores\">不符合度评分</a> 那条&quot;评分决定有用性&quot;主线的高潮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>APS 的关键转变是评分定义。朴素评分只看真标签自己的概率；APS 改看<strong>从最高概率标签累加到真标签为止的累积概率质量</strong>。直觉是：若真标签排在很靠后（模型把概率分散给了一堆标签），说明这是困难样本，累积质量大、评分高，于是需要更大的集合才能覆盖它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[模型输出 softmax 概率] --&gt; B[标签按概率降序排列]&#10;  B --&gt; C[从最高开始累加概率&lt;br/&gt;直到包含真标签]&#10;  C --&gt; D[累积质量 = APS 评分]&#10;  D --&gt; E[校准集上取分位阈值 q]&#10;  F[新样本] --&gt; G[降序累加标签&lt;br/&gt;直到累积超过 q]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[自适应集合&lt;br/&gt;易样本小 难样本大]\">flowchart TD\n  A[模型输出 softmax 概率] --&gt; B[标签按概率降序排列]\n  B --&gt; C[从最高开始累加概率&lt;br/&gt;直到包含真标签]\n  C --&gt; D[累积质量 = APS 评分]\n  D --&gt; E[校准集上取分位阈值 q]\n  F[新样本] --&gt; G[降序累加标签&lt;br/&gt;直到累积超过 q]\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[自适应集合&lt;br/&gt;易样本小 难样本大]</pre><h2 id=\"评分的精确构造\">评分的精确构造</h2><p>设模型对样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 给出各标签概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}(k \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按降序排列为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_{(1)} \\ge \\hat{p}_{(2)} \\ge \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>。对真标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，设它排在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 位，APS 的（确定性）评分为累积到它为止的质量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>r</mi></munderover><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x, y) = \\sum_{j=1}^{r} \\hat{p}_{(j)}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>校准阶段算所有校准样本的此评分，取第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil (n+1)(1-\\alpha)\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 小者为阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含上一章反复出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 修正）。预测阶段对新样本，按概率降序逐个加入标签并累加质量，一旦累积质量达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就停止——纳入的标签构成预测集。简单样本一两个标签就累过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，集合小；困难样本要加很多标签，集合大。这正是&quot;自适应&quot;的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机化-为离散评分续上精确覆盖\">随机化：为离散评分续上精确覆盖</h2><p>上面的确定性 APS 有个微妙问题：累积质量是离散跳变的，纳入&quot;刚好越过阈值&quot;的那个标签会让集合略偏大、覆盖偏保守。原始 APS（Romano 等 2020）用<strong>随机化</strong>修正：对越过阈值的那个边界标签，以一个精心计算的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 决定是否纳入，使覆盖精确落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 而非偏高。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/coverage-guarantee\">覆盖保证</a> 里提到的&quot;离散评分需随机化打破并列&quot;是同一回事。实务中若不在意轻微保守，可省略随机化用确定性版本（MAPIE 两种都支持）。</p>\n<p>下表对比朴素评分、确定性 APS、随机化 APS。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>集合大小自适应</th>\n<th>边际覆盖</th>\n<th>是否需随机化</th>\n<th>条件覆盖逼近</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素 1 减概率</td>\n<td>否（常欠困难样本）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性 APS</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>略保守</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机化 APS</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAPS（正则化）</td>\n<td>是（集合更小）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"raps-让自适应集合别太大\">RAPS：让自适应集合别太大</h2><p>APS 解决了欠覆盖，却带来新麻烦：在标签很多的任务（如 ImageNet 千类）上，困难样本的集合可能膨胀到几十上百个标签，实用性下降。RAPS（Regularized APS，Angelopoulos 等）在评分里加一个惩罚项，对排序靠后的标签施加递增的&quot;加入成本&quot;，从而抑制集合无意义地变大——它用很小的覆盖代价换来显著更紧、更可用的集合，是大类别分类 CP 的现代默认。这条&quot;先自适应、再正则化收紧&quot;的演进，呼应了整个 CP 领域&quot;先保证、再优化有用性&quot;的方法论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-aps-比朴素方法更接近条件覆盖\">为什么 APS 比朴素方法更接近条件覆盖</h2><p>APS 最深的价值不止于集合大小好看，而在于它<strong>逼近条件覆盖</strong>——即不仅平均 90%，还力图对每个难度层都接近 90%。朴素评分的欠覆盖恰恰是条件覆盖被破坏的典型表现：困难子群被系统性辜负。APS 通过让集合大小响应样本难度，把覆盖&quot;摊匀&quot;到各难度层。但要强调：APS 只是<strong>逼近</strong>而非达到条件覆盖——分布无关下的完全条件覆盖被证明不可能，这条根本性限制由 <a href=\"conditional-coverage\">条件覆盖</a> 专门讲清。APS 是在那条不可能性约束内能做到的最好实践之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>朴素分类评分让困难样本欠覆盖、简单样本过保守；APS 改用累积概率质量当评分，使集合大小随难度自动伸缩。</li>\n<li>评分 = 按概率降序累加到真标签为止的质量；预测时累加标签直到越过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>随机化处理离散评分的边界标签，使覆盖精确而非偏保守；不在意保守可用确定性版本。</li>\n<li>RAPS 加正则惩罚抑制大类别下集合膨胀，是现代默认。</li>\n<li>APS 逼近条件覆盖（把覆盖摊匀到各难度层），但完全条件覆盖被证不可能——这是其能力的理论上界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>评分设计的总脉络，APS 是其高潮：<a href=\"../methods/nonconformity-scores\">不符合度评分</a></li>\n<li>APS 逼近、但无法达到的目标及其不可能性：<a href=\"conditional-coverage\">条件覆盖</a></li>\n<li>集合大小与可解释性的关系，对照 <a href=\"../explainable-ai/local-methods/shap\">SHAP</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应预测集 (APS)","id":"自适应预测集-aps"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"评分的精确构造","id":"评分的精确构造"},{"level":2,"text":"随机化：为离散评分续上精确覆盖","id":"随机化-为离散评分续上精确覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"RAPS：让自适应集合别太大","id":"raps-让自适应集合别太大"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 APS 比朴素方法更接近条件覆盖","id":"为什么-aps-比朴素方法更接近条件覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"全共形与刀切+","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/methods/full-jackknife"},"next":{"title":"条件覆盖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/conditional-coverage"}}